  "label": "Ku Klux Klan Symbolism",
  "description": "The visual of the man in the KKK robe and hood is a direct reference to the Ku Klux Klan, a white supremacist hate group in the United States. The imagery is not just costume but a potent symbol of racial hatred and intimidation. Understanding this symbolism is essential to interpret the meme's message of racial hatred.",
